WEBVTT

00:22:57.930 --> 00:23:00.604
It's overwhelming to have
so many people watching it,

00:23:00.628 --> 00:23:01.883
congratulating you ...

00:23:01.907 --> 00:23:03.530
So I'm really, really thankful.

00:23:05.600 --> 00:23:08.529
Bianca: He was like a rock star here.

00:23:08.553 --> 00:23:11.426
Everybody wants to ask him for selfies.

00:23:11.450 --> 00:23:13.690
Now he's super confident.

00:23:13.714 --> 00:23:16.136
I'm really proud of him.

00:23:16.160 --> 00:23:17.431
NN: It changed everything.

00:23:17.455 --> 00:23:20.508
My idea was to develop this
just for the area that I worked for.

00:23:20.532 --> 00:23:23.256
I didn't think that it was
going to be this huge impact.

00:23:23.280 --> 00:23:26.655
AG: Today, Nico is finally getting
to do what he's always wanted:

00:23:26.679 --> 00:23:29.066
programming full-time for SAP.

00:23:29.090 --> 00:23:32.489
NN: I think the most important thing
was the support from my colleagues,